  skos:definition "Claude Code standing-consumption policy (docs/standing/CLAUDE_CODE_POLICY.md) + root CLAUDE.md's 'Standing' section, both pointing at target/praxis-standing/standing.json + docs/standing/REALITY_INDEX.md; real 'cargo-cicd claude_context show' command output captured at case-study/raw/claude-context-show.txt (exit 0, 28 artifact lines)." ;
